<p>The thrill of the hunt invigorates you. For each foe in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 6, 8, 10</acronym> around you, you gain 20% movement speed (up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">60%, 80%, 100%, 140%, 160%</acronym>).</p><p>Current bonus: 0%.</p>